{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jd1DShX6EK1794961778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國富商馬斯克旗下的SpaceX，據報最快周內啟動400億美元融資，用於採購人工智能(AI)晶片。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，有關融資中大約40億美元，可能會首先於幾天內發售。整筆共400億美元的融資，預期會由高盛及阿波羅全球管理擔任承銷商。SpaceX於上月曾表示，貝萊德、高盛及KKR &amp; Co.會是整筆融資的基石投資者。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.183887+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.079820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:36:53.795712+00:00","content_hash":"ffa9afd1604b7baaeed96a970a257eb454d68721a6cc4734ebb59d1a05e899b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.183887+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}